{"unit_id":"orpheus0829__dsh-identity-control#card-zh","repo":"orpheus0829/dsh-identity-control","commit":"0972a0337ba9ded7963df4fe8c74adf2925f0e67","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-identity-control-roy 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的自定义人设插件。它在对话输入栏旁提供编辑入口，并将用户填写的人设保存在 DSH settings 中。用户可以编辑多行文本、启用或停用人设并保存；启用且文本非空时，插件会把内容作为 system prompt 段注入对话，关闭或清空后移除该段。设置变化会即时生效，适合希望调整助手身份描述和交流风格的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:25-46","lib/index.mjs:22-52"]}
{"unit_id":"orpheus0829__dsh-identity-control#card-en","repo":"orpheus0829/dsh-identity-control","commit":"0972a0337ba9ded7963df4fe8c74adf2925f0e67","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-identity-control-roy adds a persona editor to the DSH web chat input. It saves text in DSH settings and injects it as a system prompt section when enabled and nonempty. Disabling or clearing it removes the section; changes apply immediately. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:25-46","lib/index.mjs:22-52"]}
